---
import LayoutPage from '../../layouts/LayoutPage.astro';
---

<LayoutPage title="Foldster's Projects — Demowall" description="GLSL shader Android live wallpapers">
  <h1>Demowall</h1>
  <p class="mono">android live wallpaper · open source · free</p>
  <p class="lede">
    Run any GLSL fragment shader as your phone wallpaper. Pick a built-in, write your own in-app, or load community shaders from Bluesky via Demosky.
  </p>

  <h2>What It Does</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>GLSL fragment shaders animate as live wallpaper</li>
    <li>In-app shader editor (write and tweak on the device)</li>
    <li>Load custom shaders from Bluesky / Demosky</li>
    <li>Standard uniforms: <code>iTime</code>, <code>iResolution</code>, <code>iPrevFrame</code></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Stack</h2>
  <p class="mono">Expo / React Native / TypeScript / custom Kotlin native module / GLSL ES 3.0</p>

  <h2>Get It</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/foldsters/universal-live-wallpaper" target="_blank">github.com/foldsters/universal-live-wallpaper</a> &mdash; source</li>
    <li>Google Play (APK published)</li>
  </ul>

  <a href="/contact/" class="cta" slot="cta">want a custom version for your stream? &rarr;</a>
</LayoutPage>
